Subject: [PATCH] pc_port: header-only sampled-animation clock/event contract
 (#431, #128)

---
 pc_port/pc_p2_sampled_clock.h   | 265 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/test_p2_sampled_clock.cpp | 168 ++++++++++++++++++++
